                        "entry_id": "a1804013-48fb-3f09-b0f3-8929a7f6bfbd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A measure of the asymmetry of the probability distribution of a real-valued random variable; is the third standardized moment, defined as scriptstyle γ₁=(μ₃)/(σ³),! where μ₃ is the third moment about the mean and σ is the standard deviation."
                        ],
